Package: shani-chronoa
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, python3-httpx, espeak-ng, pipewire, wireplumber, libnotify-bin, upower, tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-eng, bubblewrap, libsecret-1-0, psmisc, i2c-tools, policykit-1, bluez, pciutils, usbutils, smartmontools, power-profiles-daemon, udisks2, cups-client, sane-utils, nmap, network-manager, libglib2.0-bin
Suggests: soundtouch, rubberband, whisper.cpp, piper-tts, sox, python3-mcp, translate-shell, gir1.2-webkit-6.0, python3-onnxruntime, avahi-utils, libnss-mdns, iproute2, fwupd
Maintainer: Shrinivas Vishnu Kumbhar <shrinivas.v.kumbhar@gmail.com>
Description: Local AI assistant with privacy-first design, integrated into Shanios
 Shani Chronoa is a local-first AI assistant for the Shanios ecosystem.
 It provides speech-to-text via whisper.cpp, on-device LLM inference (llama.cpp by default, Ollama supported),
 and text-to-speech via Piper TTS / espeak-ng, all with a GTK4 GUI interface.
 All processing happens locally ensuring complete privacy and data sovereignty.
